- Ascend: `/root/workspace/vllm-ascend-hust`,
  `03766ac696fde5ab1980d80ca0b8543d3580c989`; the campaign's existing
  `csrc/build_aclnn.sh` modification remains present and unchanged by this audit.
- MuxPD f7: `/root/workspace/muxpd-groupfx-followup`,
  `f7ed21e183b27d2141176f3e7a5c8a5ff4ede07d`.
- MuxPD source98: `/root/workspace/muxpd-deterministic-profile-v2`,
  `98eac12dc2595a8742a81b58e96b899fed905194`.
- Earlier exact torch_npu source audit:
  `../DETERMINISM-AND-CHUNK-CONTROLS.md`, with downloaded source bindings under
  `../determinism-sources/source-identities.json`. torch_npu is 2.10.0.post4,
